  "goodToKnow": "Legendär means legendary: ein legendäres Spiel, eine legendäre Band. Like English, it's often used loosely for anything memorable: Die Party war legendär. Die Legende is a legend, and also the key on a map or chart. German football has its own legends, such as the 1954 World Cup win, das Wunder von Bern. A near synonym is sagenhaft, from die Sage (legend, saga). Stressed on the last syllable."
